格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH-in-Box: A DSH runtime and plugin packager","id":"gh:1333278479","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"dib","slug":"MaimoryLab/dib","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH-in-Box: A DSH runtime and plugin packager"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dib"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DSH-in-Box packages DeepSeek Harness with a private Node.js runtime and a small Go launcher."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`gui` targets use the operating system WebView: WebView2 on Windows, WKWebView on macOS, and WebKitG"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"TK on Linux. No browser engine is included. `serve` targets only start `dsh web`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Build"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Requirements: Go, pnpm 11.21.0, and network access. GUI launchers also require a C/C++ toolchain for"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" the target. Linux requires the GTK 4 and WebKitGTK 6.0 development packages while building, and the"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ir runtime libraries on the destination machine."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Because native WebViews use CGO, the simplest six-target release is a build matrix that runs `go run"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" . -target \"$TARGET\"` on the matching Windows, macOS, and Linux architecture. Cross builds can set `"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"cc` and `cxx` on a target in `dib.yaml` when a suitable cross-toolchain and target SDK are installed"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"c` and `cxx` on a target in `dib.yaml` when a suitable cross-toolchain and target SDK are installed:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Each archive contains `dshbox`, Node.js, `@deepseek-ai/dsh`, and packages listed in `dsh.plugins`. p"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"npm lifecycle scripts are disabled during packaging; preset plugins should therefore be published as"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ripts are disabled during packaging; preset plugins should therefore be published as built packages."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Set `icon` to a 512x512 PNG. dib converts it into the Windows executable/installer/shortcut icon, th"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e macOS app and DMG volume icon, and the Linux desktop/taskbar icon."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"`node.base_url` defaults to `https://nodejs.org/dist`; the example uses npmmirror for networks where"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" nodejs.org is unavailable. The selected source must expose Node's normal `v<version>/SHASUMS256.txt"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"` layout. Node downloads, the pnpm store, and installed DSH runtimes are reused from `cache`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## macOS DMG and signing"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`macos.format: dmg` creates an HFS+/LZMA DMG containing `DeepSeek Harness.app` and an Applications s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"hortcut. HFS+ avoids APFS padding differences between macOS runners. DMG creation requires macOS. Us"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e `tar.gz` to keep the portable archive layout."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Unsigned builds need no identity:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Signed builds sign and verify both the app bundle and final DMG:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Windows NSIS"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`windows.format: nsis` creates a compressed installer with user or machine scope, architecture and W"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"indows version checks, shortcuts, and an uninstaller. It requires `makensis`; use `zip` to keep the "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ecks, shortcuts, and an uninstaller. It requires `makensis`; use `zip` to keep the portable archive."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Install the packager with `brew install nsis` on macOS or `apt install nsis` on Debian/Ubuntu build "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"l the packager with `brew install nsis` on macOS or `apt install nsis` on Debian/Ubuntu build hosts."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The installer uses the system WebView2 runtime and does not bundle a browser engine."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Linux packages"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Linux can emit either or both nFPM-backed formats. The packages install the runtime under `/opt/dsh`"},{"id":"p26s2","text":", link `dshbox` into `/usr/bin`, and add a desktop entry. Building requires the `nfpm` command."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Dependency package names vary between distributions; set both lists for the distributions you publis"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"dency package names vary between distributions; set both lists for the distributions you publish to."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Official releases"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Run the `Release official DSH` workflow manually and enter an exact published DSH version without a "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"leading `v`. It builds unsigned macOS DMGs, Windows NSIS installers, and Linux DEB/RPM packages for "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"amd64 and arm64, then publishes them under the matching `v<dsh-version>` GitHub Release. Official re"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"lease builds always exclude preset plugins."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
